# Approved idle-motion clips are gated by a SHA-256 over the exact frame bytes
# (core/avatar_review.py). Any newline translation would silently invalidate the
# review and make the actions disappear at runtime, so keep media binary.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
